  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "A generic template for well-structured, FAIR and reproducible data analysis projects that people and AI assistants can rerun, trace and cite. It follows the project-oriented approach and includes metadata for DataCite and Zenodo, methodological decision records, provenance links from outputs to data, protocols and evidence, tests run on every push, and a skill for AI assistants. The worked example uses data from the CIMMYT market intelligence research (Donovan et al 2025, https://doi.org/10.1017/S001447972500002X). Delete the example files once the project is adapted to your needs.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
